113
00:10:03.730 --> 00:10:06.030
Tere kõik.

114
00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:12.400
Ütle ka siis tere. Tere. Tere.
Sportlik tervitus. Mis puhtatus,

115
00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:15.190
