ja jalaga on tarvis sabaga.

148
00:12:28.179 --> 00:12:31.900
Hüppab pall, hüppab pall,
keegi jalgu pole, all.

149
00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:34.680
Lendab pall lendab pall.

150
00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:45.020
Mul meeldib palli taguda,
kui pallile meeldib kaduda kord rohu

151
00:12:45.020 --> 00:12:48.380
