183
00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:53.400
Tere, ema.

184
00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:56.490
Valmi.

185
00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:59.220
Hommikene,
sa jõudsid just parajaks ajaks koju,

186
00:16:59.320 --> 00:17:03.130
